{"4042070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angels In Orbit", "steam_appid": 4042070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not about saving the world, it’s about answering for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2170. An anomaly has ripped through the AIO Station, leaving a lone technician fighting to survive. As the silence of deep space closes in, biblical angels descend, beginning trials of morality, judgment, and the price of human ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when judgment comes and survival hangs by a thread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Driven: </strong>The angel encounters are a core component of the experience: branching, reactive dialogues, where every choice is personal, and every consequence is earned. When faced with difficult themes, will you evade the truth to find solace in lies? Or will you be a witness after humanity has already committed its sins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/7f76794f44c68aa61167de2d92d06296.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/7f76794f44c68aa61167de2d92d06296.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/7f76794f44c68aa61167de2d92d06296.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice &amp; Consequence:</strong> Every decision carries weight. The order and nature of the questions determine <i>Veris</i>’ fate and humanity’s resolution. Multiple endings reflect not victory or defeat, but the truths you chose to face, or deny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/3622140e6ff0bb90b362a2b80286113c.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/3622140e6ff0bb90b362a2b80286113c.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/3622140e6ff0bb90b362a2b80286113c.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Navigate a collapsing space station filled with clues, logs, and environmental storytelling. Piece together the hidden purpose of the <i>AIO Station</i>, the origins of the anomaly, and the truths buried in the wreckage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/f47d04459293e162d50b7401d9da829f.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/f47d04459293e162d50b7401d9da829f.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/f47d04459293e162d50b7401d9da829f.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Technician</strong>: Repair broken systems, restore failing machinery and improvise to survive. Your skills as a technician are both a lifeline and a test: can you find a way to escape? Or is judgement inevitable?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/75635b54347b1c1ec8f166ae4bd67184.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/75635b54347b1c1ec8f166ae4bd67184.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/75635b54347b1c1ec8f166ae4bd67184.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Powers:</strong> Unlock powerful abilities through the <i>Trinity Tree</i>, to balance survival with divine intervention. Utilize the <i>Procurement System</i> to acquire vital supplies, upgrade the station, and customize your loyal robot companion, <i>Canabelle</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/18548bc9878fef56cf7044298a891083.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/18548bc9878fef56cf7044298a891083.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/18548bc9878fef56cf7044298a891083.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> <i>Alter</i> stalks the corridors, neither man nor divine. His relentless pursuit is merciless and unpredictable. Is he beyond redemption? Are you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/6cb7f3b16b8b7430c15d25286e0454c1.poster.avif?t=1787544138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/6cb7f3b16b8b7430c15d25286e0454c1.webm?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042070/extras/6cb7f3b16b8b7430c15d25286e0454c1.mp4?t=1787544138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre: </strong><i>Existential sci‑fi horror, stealth survival mechanics, branching dialogue trees and multiple endings.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not about saving the world, it’s about answering for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2170. An anomaly has ripped through the AIO Station, leaving a lone technician fighting to survive. As the silence of deep space closes in, biblical angels descend, beginning trials of morality, judgment, and the price of human ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when judgment comes and survival hangs by a thread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Driven: </strong>The angel encounters are a core component of the experience: branching, reactive dialogues, where every choice is personal, and every consequence is earned. When faced wi